.Sh BUGS
Add support for
.Nm geckodriver ,
.Nm puppeteer ,
and other WebDriver/Selenium-based methods of browser automation.
.
.Pp
Firefox\ Beta releases are not supported,
and Developer Edition is erroneously included in searches when the
.Fl -unstable
flag hasn't been set.
Moreover,
as there are
.Dq several
unstable release channels of Firefox,
an option or environment variable should be added \
to select a release channel by name.
.
.Pp
Support for branded alternatives to Firefox
.Pq LibreWolf , Floorp , Tor ,
Google\ Chrome
.Pq Brave\ Browser ,
Opera
.Pq Opera\ Air, Opera\ GX, Opera\ Neon ,
and LadyBird once it's stable.
